#: manifest_strings_autogenerated.py:2
msgid "Create tasks by selecting images directly from Google Drive"
msgstr "Izradite zadatke odabirom slika izravno s Google Drivea"

#: plugin.py:13
msgid "OAuth Client ID"
msgstr "OAuth ID klijenta"

#: plugin.py:14
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API ključ"

#: plugin.py:27 plugin.py:48 templates/settings.html:5
msgid "Google Drive"
msgstr "Google Drive"

#: plugin.py:42
msgid "Settings updated."
msgstr "Postavke su ažurirane."

#: templates/settings.html:6
msgid ""
"Allow users to select images from Google Drive when creating new tasks. "
"Create the credentials below in the Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr ""
"Omogućite korisnicima odabir slika s Google Drivea pri izradi novih "
"zadataka. Izradite vjerodajnice navedene u nastavku u konzoli Google Cloud "
"Console:"

#: templates/settings.html:8
msgid ""
"Create a project and enable the <b>Google Drive API</b> and the <b>Google "
"Picker API</b>."
msgstr ""
"Izradite projekt i omogućite <b>Google Drive API</b> i <b>Google Picker "
"API</b>."

#: templates/settings.html:9
msgid ""
"Open <b>APIs & Services → OAuth consent screen</b> (Google Auth Platform). "
"Fill in <b>Branding</b>, then in <b>Audience</b> add your users as test "
"users or publish the app."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite <b>API-ji i usluge → Zaslon za pristanak OAuth</b> (Google Auth "
"Platform). Ispunite <b>Brendiranje</b>, a zatim u odjeljku <b>Publika</b> "
"dodajte svoje korisnike kao testne korisnike ili objavite aplikaciju."

#: templates/settings.html:10
msgid "In <b>Data Access</b>, click <b>Add or remove scopes</b> and add:"
msgstr ""
"U odjeljku <b>Pristup podacima</b> kliknite <b>Dodaj ili ukloni opsege</b> i "
"dodajte:"

#: templates/settings.html:11
msgid ""
"In <b>Clients</b>, create a client of type <b>Web application</b> and add "
"this address to the Authorized JavaScript origins:"
msgstr ""
"U odjeljku <b>Klijenti</b> izradite klijent vrste <b>Web-aplikacija</b> i "
"dodajte ovu adresu u ovlaštena JavaScript ishodišta:"

#: templates/settings.html:12
msgid ""
"In <b>APIs & Services → Credentials</b>, click <b>Create credentials → API "
"key</b>. Under <b>API restrictions</b>, choose <b>Restrict key</b> and "
"select the <b>Google Drive API</b> and the <b>Google Picker API</b>. "
"Optionally, under <b>Application restrictions</b>, choose <b>Websites</b> "
"and add:"
msgstr ""
"U odjeljku <b>API-ji i usluge → Vjerodajnice</b> kliknite <b>Izradi "
"vjerodajnice → API ključ</b>. Pod <b>Ograničenja API-ja</b> odaberite "
"<b>Ograniči ključ</b> i odaberite <b>Google Drive API</b> i <b>Google Picker "
"API</b>. Po želji, pod <b>Ograničenja aplikacije</b> odaberite "
"<b>Web-stranice</b> i dodajte:"

#: templates/settings.html:14
msgid ""
"Google only accepts HTTPS addresses or http://localhost as JavaScript "
"origins."
msgstr ""
"Google kao JavaScript ishodišta prihvaća samo HTTPS adrese ili "
"http://localhost."

#: templates/settings.html:15
msgid "Open Google Cloud Console"
msgstr "Otvori Google Cloud Console"

#: templates/settings.html:20
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Spremi"
